<p>Game Art in general is created via various external Applications, <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/3rd%20party%20extensions" title="3rd party extensions">3rd_party_extensions</a> ,and with the Dragon Age Toolset. Which you will need depends only on the type of Resource.
</p><p>Sound and Music is covered in the Article: <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Sound%20and%20music" title="Sound and music">Sound and music</a>
</p>
